OL,3,GNEWSAThe ladies who have lunched every
OL,4,Amonth for 50 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F1976 was the year of a record-breaking
OL,7,Fhot summer, prime minister Harold
OL,8,FWilson's resignation, and Abba topping
OL,9,Fthe charts.
OL,11,FIn the quiet West Yorkshire village of
OL,12,FLedsham, it was when a group of young
OL,13,Fwomen began meeting for a monthly lunch
OL,14,Fclub which is still going strong 50
OL,15,Fyears later.
OL,17,FThen new mothers, they wanted the
OL,18,Flunches to offer friendship and
OL,19,Fcompanionship, and the socialising
OL,20,Fcontinues now the original members are
OL,21,Fin their 70s and 80s.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
